<title>ITALY: Fiat prepares to launch Palio Weekend.</title>
<headline>Fiat prepares to launch Palio Weekend.</headline>
<dateline>TURIN 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian carmaker Fiat Auto said it will in the next few weeks present the new station wagon version of its Palio world car.</p>
<p>The new model, called Palio Weekend, will be shown for the first time from October 23 and will become commercially available in Brazil in the first months of 1997, according to a Fiat note.</p>
<p>The new model follows the launch of the Palio in Brazil in April 1996 and will be produced in Fiat's Brazilian car plant.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129502</p>
